<item><title>Mauritius records 27 947 road offences in nine months</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/mu/mauritius-records-27-947-road-offences-in-nine-months-2ee19f/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/mu/mauritius-records-27-947-road-offences-in-nine-months-2ee19f/</guid><category>Mauritius</category><description>The third Penalty Point System review lists speeding and seat-belt violations among the most common offences recorded through 31 October 2026.</description><pubDate>Sat, 21 Nov 2026 08:16:37 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/mu.jpg" length="32856" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/mu.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
<item><title>Port-Louis Waterfront festival caps dishes at Rs 275</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/mu/port-louis-waterfront-festival-caps-dishes-at-rs-275-7ff265/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/mu/port-louis-waterfront-festival-caps-dishes-at-rs-275-7ff265/</guid><category>Mauritius</category><description>More than 30 food stands are part of the second edition, with concerts and DJ sets scheduled from 19 h to 21 h on Saturday and Sunday.</description><pubDate>Sat, 21 Nov 2026 05:56:05 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/mu.jpg" length="32856" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/mu.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
<item><title>Ramgoolam wants Port-Louis busy after office hours</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/mu/ramgoolam-wants-port-louis-busy-after-office-hours-b7fae6/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/mu/ramgoolam-wants-port-louis-busy-after-office-hours-b7fae6/</guid><category>Mauritius</category><description>Speaking at the Caudan Waterfront&apos;s 30th anniversary, Prime Minister Navin Ramgoolam said the capital should be a place where Mauritians gather after work.</description><pubDate>Fri, 20 Nov 2026 18:11:19 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/mu.jpg" length="32856" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/mu.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
<item><title>Mauritius approves Rs 920 million plan to ease water shortage</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/mu/mauritius-approves-rs-920-million-plan-to-ease-water-9a839b/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/mu/mauritius-approves-rs-920-million-plan-to-ease-water-9a839b/</guid><category>Mauritius</category><description>The plan adds transfers from three reservoirs and dams, new 30 m³ tanks, borehole pumps and tanker deliveries to the worst-hit areas.</description><pubDate>Fri, 20 Nov 2026 17:39:58 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/mu/mauritius-approves-rs-920-million-plan-to-ease-water-9a839b/share.jpg" length="41925" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/mu/mauritius-approves-rs-920-million-plan-to-ease-water-9a839b/share.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
<item><title>Mauritius tells drivers to report errors in digital licences before 1 January</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/mu/mauritius-tells-drivers-to-report-errors-in-digital-7f219a/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/mu/mauritius-tells-drivers-to-report-errors-in-digital-7f219a/</guid><category>Mauritius</category><description>The Kenya-style KOREK! app, which Mauritius calls its digital licence app, shows data drawn from police records, so errors must be corrected by the Traffic Branch.</description><pubDate>Fri, 20 Nov 2026 15:04:02 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/mu.jpg" length="32856" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/mu.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
